{
  "title": "创建修订版",
  "html": "<html><head></head><body><div>\n  <h1>创建修订版</h1>\n  <p class=\"Procedure_Title\">创建新修订版的步骤：</p>\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n    <ol>\n      <li class=\"Numbered\">从导航窗格中，选择 <strong>Administration&gt;Revisions</strong>。出现以下菜单：</li>\n    </ol>\n    <p class=\"Figure_indented\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/aras-images/revisionsmenu.jpg\">\n      <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n        <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n    </p>\n    <ol start=\"2\">\n      <li class=\"Numbered\">点击 <strong>Create New Revision</strong>（创建新修订版）。出现一个空白的修订版窗口：\n        <p class=\"Figure_indented\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/aras-images/rev1.jpg\">\n          <!--?rh-list_start level=\"1\" an=\"1\" class=\"rl-p-Figure_indented\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n            <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n              <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n        </p>\n      </li>\n    </ol>\n    <ol start=\"3\">\n      <li class=\"Numbered\">填写以下属性：\n        <ul>\n          <li class=\"Bulleted_list\">Name（名称） - 修订版的名称。</li>\n          <li class=\"Bulleted_list\">Revisions（修订版） - 要使用的新修订版名称系列。这些名称应该是有序的，并且在顺序和递增方面易于识别。</li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n    </ol>\n    <ol start=\"4\">\n      <li class=\"Numbered\">点击 <img src=\"/aras-images/done.jpg\"> 以保存并释放此条目。</li>\n    </ol>\n    <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n      <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"2\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n        \n        \n        \n        \n        <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n\n</div></body></html>",
  "sourceFile": "Creating_a_Revsion.htm"
}